# Tracked on purpose, to keep this directory present in a fresh clone.
#
# docker-compose.yml bind-mounts it into qdrant-load. Docker creates a missing
# bind source as root, and then nothing but root can write here -- which is how
# a snapshot restore fails with a permission error nobody expects. An existing
# directory is owned by whoever cloned the repo, so the problem never arises.
#
# Shipped *.snapshot files go here. They are gitignored; fetch them from the
# release that matches your checkout.
